Role asignado Agente de viajes:

GRANT
    CREATE SESSION,
    SELECT ANY TABLE,
    UPDATE ANY TABLE,
    INSERT ANY TABLE
TO Rl_agt_agencia;

-------------------------------------------------
Role asignado a Supervisor:

GRANT
    CREATE SESSION,
    SELECT ANY TABLE,
    UPDATE ANY TABLE,
    CREATE PROCEDURE,
    CREATE VIEW
TO Rl_spv_agencia;

